  "extraction_notes": [
    "Curve points are direct readings from the plotted transfer, ON-region, and capacitance traces on pages 3 and 4.",
    "The datasheet publishes Ciss = 50 pF MAX, Coss = 25 pF MAX, and Crss = 5 pF MAX at VDS = 25 V, VGS = 0 V, f = 1 MHz; the scalar capacitance fields retain the published TYP values.",
    "The datasheet publishes IDSS maximum values of 1 uA at TJ = 25 degC and 500 uA at TJ = 125 degC; IDSS has no field in the strict MOSFET schema.",
    "The datasheet publishes no body-diode reverse-recovery time (trr).",
    "Only junction-to-ambient thermal resistance RThetaJA = 556 degC/W is published; RThetaJC is not published.",
    "No gate resistance or total gate-charge specification is published."
  ],
